window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I am Fliss, and my magic has abandoned me.</p> <p>After suffering a painful defeat and barely escaping with my life, my dragons and I are on the run. My sister will stop at nothing to end my existence and prevent me from taking my rightful place over the realm.</p> <p>A war of gods and men has broken out across the kingdom, and we cannot fight it on our own. I must seek out the city of sirens, and repair the magical community that’s in shambles if we’re to win.</p> <p>The goddess of song will rise to battle the goddess of chaos...and the victor will change the world forever.</p> <p>Experience the breathtaking conclusion of the Song of Dragonfire series. This is a historical fantasy novel featuring medieval dragons, mermaids, fae, and magical realms.</p>"; 
